# Files & Purpose

| File                   | Tool Used            | Why                                         |
| ---------------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| `Textarea.jsx`         | React (`forwardRef`) | Rendering, accessibility, helper/error text |
| `Textarea.variants.js` | CVA                  | Variants, sizes, resize behavior            |
| `index.js`             | —                    | Barrel export                               |
